      "statement": "A bron is an ingestable data source; each is assigned a globally unique BronId up front by a human, not auto-generated, because the id keys the known-hash store, observations, and seed rows so two sources sharing one cross-contaminate as soon as either goes live. Uniqueness across the SOURCES registry is asserted by sources.spec.ts.",
