      "id": "claim_413d2dd24c4b429b997239700fc7acae",
      "statement": "The aanvraag lifecycle has four states (active, stale, closed, unknown) as a const tuple and Effect Schema. resolveLifecycleStatus is a pure function deriving the next status from LifecycleTransitionInput (bronSaysClosed, sluitingsdatumPassed, seenOpen, missedPolls, missedPollsBeforeStale, current).",
