    {
      "id": "claim_cbe2276b8f9f44029ab931c4904530e6",
      "statement": "When a source genuinely does not publish a field, the field is UNKNOWN (sentinel string 'unknown') with honest provenance — never inferred from a neighbouring field. isUnknown narrows the sentinel; UnknownValueSchema is the Effect Schema literal. UNKNOWN is distinct from CLEARED ('cleared'), which is the explicit clear tombstone that overwrites a last-known curated value with null; CLEARED_BRON_MARKER_KEY ('_cleared') records which commercial keys were intentionally cleared.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://AGENTS.md#L47-L48",
