    {
      "id": "claim_4f9b0aa8b507471c9f6f5499c22e5ea8",
      "statement": "NormalisedAanvraagDraft uses UNKNOWN and CLEARED sentinels throughout: bronUrl, locatieTekst, opdrachtgeverNaam, and startDatum are string | typeof UNKNOWN; the NormalisedTarief subfields (eenheid, max, min) are TariefEenheid | typeof CLEARED | typeof UNKNOWN. This keeps the distinction between 'the source does not publish this' and 'the source published this and we cleared it' durable through the pipeline.",
