      "id": "claim_0b48a89eaf084cf98bb2ecd21111f060",
      "statement": "schema-helpers.ts provides shared Effect Schema primitives (NonEmptyString, TrimmedNonEmptyString, FiniteNumber, IntegerNumber, PositiveInteger, NonNegativeInteger, DomainIdString, BronReferentieSchema, BronNaamSchema) from which the domain models are built. BRON_REFERENTIE_MAX_LENGTH (2000) and BRON_NAAM_MAX_LENGTH (200) caps reflect physical btree index limits. Production Effect runtime activation stays off in this package — the only effect import is Schema, re-exported for a stable surface.",
